  "description": "Additive successor to rule-artifact.v8. Adds a bounded declared exclusive-presence selection and a distinct declarative sum aggregation shape. The package validator authorizes the selection shape only for the exact nominee line-2b successor and the aggregation shape only for its distinct nominee subtotal producer; copied syntax has no runtime binding path. v1-v8 remain immutable history."
